<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES UNCHANGED.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES UNCHANGED.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>were steady at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate was flat at 3.07 percent.</p>
<p>			 February 13 fix	February 12 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	  3.00 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	  3.04 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	  3.07 pct		3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	  3.16 pct		3.16 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	  3.24 pct		3.25 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	 3.32 pct		3.33 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 248</p>
</text>
